  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Given nnn (nnn is **even**), determine the number of **black cells** in an n×nn \\times nn×n chessboard. \n\nUpdate the function given in the IDE to solve the problem.\n\n\n\nInput Format\nThe only line of the input contains a single integer nnn.\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nOutput the number of black cells in an n×nn \\times nn×n chessboard.",
    "constraints": [
      "2≤n≤1002 \\leq n \\leq 1002≤n≤100",
      "nnn is even"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
